176 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear RemoFirst team\054\nI\031m applying for the Senior Product Designer role because the problems you\031re solving sit close to the kind of product design work I\031ve focused on throughout my career\072 making complex workflows understandable and usable while balancing customer needs\054 product goals and technical constraints\056\nMost recently at Remuner\054 I designed and shipped a production AI agent used by sales reps and managers to work with commission data\054 sales plans and team information\056 I owned the interaction and conversation design\054 including capability scoping\054 response formats\054 and trust and accuracy patterns\054 working closely with Product and Engineering\056\nPreviously at Abacum\054 I worked on complex data workflows for finance teams\056 I designed Dataset Manager\054 a product layer over JSON configuration that allowed finance teams to manage their data without engineering support\054 and helped standardise the formula language used across the modelling layer\056 This work involved customer feedback\054 competitor research and close collaboration with Engineering to make complex underlying systems easier to use\056\nI also bring experience building design systems and working as a sole designer\054 giving me a strong understanding of both product\055level decisions and the practical realities of getting them into production\056\nI\031d be interested in bringing this combination of product thinking\054 complex workflow design and AI interaction experience to RemoFirst\056\nBest\054\050Manel Leiva)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 175 0 R
     /Pg 170 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
